  "description": "The concept of 'first loss' refers to the initial defeat or failure in a competitive or significant endeavor. It is a common human experience that evokes strong emotional responses such as embarrassment, disappointment, or self-doubt. This concept is essential to understand the emotional resonance of the meme, as it frames the tiger's defeat as a relatable human experience.",
